cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the XAI Evaluation Card, please cite the paper.
title: "XAI Evaluation Cards"
abstract: >-
  Templates, a JSON Schema and a card builder for the XAI Evaluation Card, a documentation
  template analogous to model cards and datasheets, designed to accompany any study that
  introduces an explainable AI (XAI) evaluation metric. The card covers explicit declaration
  of target properties, grounding levels, metric assumptions, validation evidence, gaming
  risks, and known failure cases.
